# The SBOM generator, outside the project's own dependency graph: the tool that
# describes that graph is not a member of it. `sbom.txt` pins it and everything
# it pulls in by version and hash, so the release job and `make sbom` install
# the same versions, from files whose hashes are recorded. Regenerate it after
# changing this file, from this directory:
#
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --strip-extras --allow-unsafe sbom.in
cyclonedx-bom==7.3.1
